            </p>
            <div className="text-[var(--good)] font-ui text-sm font-bold pt-2 border-t border-[var(--line)] flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>✓ Offline QNX Edge Computing</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      {/* Action Footer with Glowing Guiding Next Button */}
      <div className="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-[var(--line)]">
        <span className="font-ui text-base font-semibold text-[var(--dim)]">
